288
00:19:14.981 --> 00:19:17.383
applied the plan to a fake by its hash,

289
00:19:17.383 --> 00:19:21.945
as the pipeline and as a person, and
saw a plan nobody approved refused.

290
00:19:21.945 --> 00:19:27.530
The evidence an ISSO keeps for Gate 5 from
